  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* feat: provide a sandboxed subset of WASI to Wasm plugins (#1303)\r\n\r\nThis is going to enable dprint-plugin-roslyn to be a Wasm plugin and run sandboxed.\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|dede71277f9f48a27d989debb3ddb7da1a1c2dc1c8c64d964d49d6ebc94112be|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|397ccc359e3197e11505c9bef40e6bbc46a2f80796658b3b7d13f6fec747ccc9|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|31480ef00f2dc3ddea18af9128c6a2edb496396317a94d2b7c11d5169ef0051f|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|56cd3455fe1dcf7827d33841d312be0e724ae4285b850b9aeb8159fbd4437f11|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|edf2b0a0b45b6a5b761cfe463c588f78af507bf80b899d5663c97cff73b0da43|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|07c2466d4ed63cb3f5d44b6ebde34367ae9bdf007eaa809bb378e617a138835f|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|5ee6253556ec8abd66821cadaa2317363f5bee14b3e62d63a67630984038cfc4|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|8a0b3f6dfab5fc401b803811b01f0bb735702d75d95c0a17fd15872144fb2e96|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|eab402514be03002ad833e5c966b056a4de2cec63b747add57f845756a67e264|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|0c8c2d336b5354fc810c20e0a2fec825a9bb476d3140ab12f0be7f76a6a33de4|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|9fbbad680fa49c311e10ea6aa991344699732df6928ad30b374c0d100970eae2|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|bf5915a3900a75cdab48ba5157f8a2b